Main:

for every light:
	start thread



Classes:

Arduino:
	all functions to write to and read from arduino.
	Input is name and device location(ttyUSB0)

APA102:
	handler for apa102 light strips.
	input is name and amount of pixels



Website:

Use this for colorpicker on the website: http://jscolor.com/examples/
This may prevents you from having to write your own app.

color POST handler:
	get lightid. set lightID.color_rgb
	if lightid == 'all':
		for key,value in lightids:
			value.color_rgb = POSTdata
